OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with making Nazi
OL,4,Asalute at synagogue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with a racially
OL,7,Faggravated offence after he allegedly
OL,8,Fgave a Nazi salute outside a synagogue.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police said it happened
OL,11,Fas worshippers were leaving the place
OL,12,Fof worship in Croxdale Road,
OL,13,FBorehamwood, on Saturday 9 May.
OL,15,FThe 19-year-old, from Watford, was
OL,16,Farrested on 22 May and has since been
OL,17,Fcharged with a racially/religiously
OL,18,Faggravated Section 5 public order
OL,19,Foffence.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
