OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with making Nazi
OL,4,Asalute at synagogue
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is due to appear at St Albans
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Friday 16
OL,8,FOctober. He was released on bail and
OL,9,Ftold not to attend any synagogues in
OL,10,FEngland or to return to Croxdale Road.
